        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Evaluate <span class=\"math\">[MATH: |x - 6| + 2 x +3]</span> for <span class=\"math\">[MATH: x = -3.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Evaluate [MATH: |x - 6| + 2 x +3] for [MATH: x = -3.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>We substitute <span class=\"math\">[MATH: x = -3]</span> and then evaluate the absolute value before we simplify the rest of the expression:\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: |x \u2212 6|+ 2x + 3|=;|\u2212 3 \u2212 6|+ 2(\u2212 3) + 3|=;|\u2212 9|+ 2(\u2212 3) + 3|=; 9 + 2(\u2212 3) + 3|=; 9 \u2212 6 + 3|=; 6]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "We substitute [MATH: x = -3] and then evaluate the absolute value before we simplify the rest of the expression:\n[MATH: |x \u2212 6|+ 2x + 3|=;|\u2212 3 \u2212 6|+ 2(\u2212 3) + 3|=;|\u2212 9|+ 2(\u2212 3) + 3|=; 9 + 2(\u2212 3) + 3|=; 9 \u2212 6 + 3|=; 6]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nEvaluate [MATH: |x - 6| + 2 x +3] for [MATH: x = -3.]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nWe substitute [MATH: x = -3] and then evaluate the absolute value before we simplify the rest of the expression:\n[MATH: |x \u2212 6|+ 2x + 3|=;|\u2212 3 \u2212 6|+ 2(\u2212 3) + 3|=;|\u2212 9|+ 2(\u2212 3) + 3|=; 9 + 2(\u2212 3) + 3|=; 9 \u2212 6 + 3|=; 6]"
      },
